    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a8-a3">

                <pb facs="0311" n="965" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg965"/>

                <p>Mr. Lozano having stated that his other witnesses reside at San Francisco de
                    Apodaca, and that they cannot come in consequence of the distance, let these
                    questions be sent to the citizen second alcalde of said town that he may be
                    pleased to examine such persons as may be presented to him by the said Lozano.
                    This having been done, let him transmit the testimony to this court. The citizen
                    district judge of Nuevo Leon so ordered, and signed before me, the secretary. I
                    certify.</p>
                <p>The licentiate,</p>
                <closer><signed>VALDEZ GOMEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pablo Borrego</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
